      "name": "Are visual schedules really effective for older kids?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Even teenagers benefit from visual or written checklists. Executive function struggles don't disappear with age; offloading the 'remembering' onto a physical list frees up cognitive energy."
